          {
            "author": "Ken",
            "date": "2025-09-20T17:30:00+01:00",
            "stars": "3",
            "snippet": "We had a solid although not spectacular experience at Leicester Square Kitchen.  The food was good but the service slow.  We told the server we were going to theatre but had to chase someone down at the end of the meal after waiting over ten minutes for someone to come over for us to pay the bill.  The ambiance wasn't helped by the deafening din from a very large group (dozens) in a private function taking place right beside the main dining room.",
